  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAUei6a_d.webp?maxwidth=760&amp;fidelity=grand\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\"></strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>All the Mods</strong>&nbsp;最初只是我為幾個朋友準備的私人整合包，結果卻變成了其他人也想玩的內容！它包含了大多數其他「知名」整合包的所有基本內容，同時也加入了一些較新或較少為人知的模組，達到良好的平衡。<br><br>這次最大的變化是我們現在使用<strong>NeoForge</strong>，並且版本升級到<strong>1.21</strong>。隨著模組陸續推出，敬請期待眾多更新！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在<strong>All the Mods 10</strong>中，我們將延續傳統，加入許多新模組，同時追求更高的穩定性。</p><p><strong>「All the Mods」真的包含了</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>模組嗎？不，當然沒有。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nrj9TOe.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"155\"><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hALnQl07S7E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></a></p><p><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ftNxcMu0fE0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FvbkI2Zk6Uo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XA8ZiUZpJyo\" alt=\"\"></p><p><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/J3J7CLX42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\"></a></p>",
